    "problem": " <script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-chtml.js\"></script>  Considere um quadrado representado em um plano cartesiano através de 4 valores. Os valores <b>x1</b> e <b>x2</b> representam a posição inicial e final do quadrado na horizontal e <b>y1</b> e <b>y2</b> representam a posição inicial e final do quadrado na vertical. </p>  <svg width=\"150px\" height=\"150px\" viewBox=\"0 0 78.708801 74.709808\" version=\"1.1\" id=\"svg5\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; padding: 25px;\" inkscape:version=\"1.1 (c68e22c387, 2021-05-23)\" sodipodi:docname=\"quadrado.svg\" xmlns:inkscape=\"http://www.inkscape.org/namespaces/inkscape\" xmlns:sodipodi=\"http://sodipodi.sourceforge.net/DTD/sodipodi-0.dtd\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <sodipodi:namedview id=\"namedview7\" pagecolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#666666\" borderopacity=\"1.0\" inkscape:pageshadow=\"2\" inkscape:pageopacity=\"0.0\" inkscape:pagecheckerboard=\"0\" inkscape:document-units=\"mm\" showgrid=\"false\" showguides=\"false\" inkscape:zoom=\"0.72337262\" inkscape:cx=\"510.80175\" inkscape:cy=\"292.38044\" inkscape:window-width=\"1920\" inkscape:window-height=\"1001\" inkscape:window-x=\"-9\" inkscape:window-y=\"-9\" inkscape:window-maximized=\"1\" inkscape:current-layer=\"layer1\" /> <defs id=\"defs2\"> <rect x=\"22.80982\" y=\"100.22497\" width=\"53.222916\" height=\"149.30064\" id=\"rect26442\" /> </defs> <g inkscape:label=\"Layer 1\" inkscape:groupmode=\"layer\" id=\"layer1\" transform=\"translate(-13.043386,-16.092623)\"> <path style=\"fill:none;stroke:#313b61;stroke-width:1.465;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:miter;stroke-miterlimit:4;stroke-dasharray:none;stroke-opacity:1\" d=\"M 25.237684,16.825123 25.603448,81.56527\" id=\"path911\" /> <path style=\"fill:none;stroke:#313b61;stroke-width:1.465;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:miter;stroke-miterlimit:4;stroke-dasharray:none;stroke-opacity:1\" d=\"M 25.603448,81.56527 90.343596,81.199506\" id=\"path911-9\" /> <rect style=\"fill:none;stroke:#313b61;stroke-width:1.465;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-miterlimit:4;stroke-dasharray:none;stroke-opacity:1\" id=\"rect1075\" width=\"24.871922\" height=\"24.871922\" x=\"46.086208\" y=\"36.576355\" /> <text xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:7.76111px;line-height:1.25;font-family:sans-serif;fill:#000000;fill-opacity:1;stroke:none;stroke-width:0.264583\" x=\"42.062805\" y=\"90.753166\" id=\"text2523\"><tspan sodipodi:role=\"line\" id=\"tspan2521\" style=\"font-size:7.76111px;fill:#313b61;fill-opacity:1;stroke-width:0.264583\" x=\"42.062805\" y=\"90.753166\">x1</tspan></text> <text xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:7.76111px;line-height:1.25;font-family:sans-serif;fill:#000000;fill-opacity:1;stroke:none;stroke-width:0.264583\" x=\"12.812221\" y=\"38.819584\" id=\"text2523-9\"><tspan sodipodi:role=\"line\" id=\"tspan2521-6\" style=\"font-size:7.76111px;fill:#313b61;fill-opacity:1;stroke-width:0.264583\" x=\"12.812221\" y=\"38.819584\">y2</tspan></text> <text xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:7.76111px;line-height:1.25;font-family:sans-serif;fill:#000000;fill-opacity:1;stroke:none;stroke-width:0.264583\" x=\"12.973278\" y=\"64.162376\" id=\"text2523-9-7\"><tspan sodipodi:role=\"line\" id=\"tspan2521-6-0\" style=\"font-size:7.76111px;fill:#313b61;fill-opacity:1;stroke-width:0.264583\" x=\"12.973278\" y=\"64.162376\">y1</tspan></text> <text xml:space=\"preserve\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:7.76111px;line-height:1.25;font-family:sans-serif;fill:#000000;fill-opacity:1;stroke:none;stroke-width:0.264583\" x=\"65.396683\" y=\"90.802429\" id=\"text2523-6\"><tspan sodipodi:role=\"line\" id=\"tspan2521-3\" style=\"font-size:7.76111px;fill:#313b61;fill-opacity:1;stroke-width:0.264583\" x=\"65.396683\" y=\"90.802429\">x2</tspan></text> <text xml:space=\"preserve\" transform=\"scale(0.26458333)\" id=\"text26440\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:40px;line-height:1.25;font-family:sans-serif;white-space:pre;shape-inside:url(#rect26442);fill:#000000;fill-opacity:1;stroke:none\" /> <path style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:0.258902;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-linejoin:miter;stroke-miterlimit:4;stroke-dasharray:0.258902, 1.03561;stroke-dashoffset:0;stroke-opacity:1\" d=\"m 25.416663,36.963404 66.20468,-0.715686\" id=\"path27979\" sodipodi:nodetypes=\"cc\" /> <path style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:0.252278;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-linejoin:miter;stroke-miterlimit:4;stroke-dasharray:0.252278, 1.00911;stroke-dashoffset:0;stroke-opacity:1\" d=\"m 45.641177,17.155744 0.712047,63.181197\" id=\"path27979-6\" sodipodi:nodetypes=\"cc\" /> <path style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:0.252278;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-linejoin:miter;stroke-miterlimit:4;stroke-dasharray:0.252278, 1.00911;stroke-dashoffset:0;stroke-opacity:1\" d=\"m 70.783914,17.271287 0.712047,63.181134\" id=\"path27979-6-7\" sodipodi:nodetypes=\"cc\" /> <path style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:0.259222;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-linejoin:miter;stroke-miterlimit:4;stroke-dasharray:0.259222, 1.03689;stroke-dashoffset:0;stroke-opacity:1\" d=\"M 25.117938,61.98662 91.505417,61.271139\" id=\"path27979-7\" sodipodi:nodetypes=\"cc\" /> </g> </svg>  Agora considere o problema de determinar se um ponto neste plano cartesiano, representado pelas coordenadas <b>x</b> e <b>y</b> está contido ou não dentro deste quadrado. O ponto estará contido se suas coordenadas estiverem nos limites do quadrado, nas duas dimensões (x e y). </p>  Neste problema você deve criar um programa que receba como entrada 6 valores. As entradas <b>x1</b>, <b>x2</b>, <b>y1</b>, <b>y2</b> contendo os valores limites de um quadrado em um plano cartesiano. Além destas, as entradas <b>x</b> e <b>y</b> representam as coordenadas de um ponto no plano cartesiano, sendo necessário determinar se este ponto está dentro ou fora do quadrado. O programa deve produzir como saída a cadeia de caracteres \"dentro\" ou \"fora\" indicando se o ponto está contido ou não nos limites do quadrado respectivamente.  <h3>Entradas</h3> Seis números reais <b>x1</b>, <b>x2</b>, <b>y1</b>, <b>y2</b> contendo a espeficação do quadrado e <b>x</b> ou <b>y</b> contendo a especificação do ponto. </p>  <h3>Saída</h3> Uma cadeia de caracteres contendo os valores \"dentro\" ou \"fora\". </p> "
